    "body": "@spiral-ladder not a review comment. Nico asked us to check whether Lodestar has the same pubkey cache problem Lighthouse fixed in sigp/lighthouse#10569. I reproduced it against our state transition, and this PR implements the design he signed off on: only the finalized prefix stays in the shared cache, and unfinalized pubkeys are checked against each state's registry.\n",
